    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours that the enemy unit targeted with at least 1 attack.\n\nUntil the phase ends, whenever 1 of your unit's models is **destroyed** before it has fought this phase, roll a D6, adding 2 for a **CHARACTER** model. On a 4+:\n\n- The model stays in play.\n- After the attacking unit finishes its attacks, it can fight as if it had 1 wound left.\n- It is then removed.",
